netstat -tlnp | grep 8000

# Restart
sudo systemctl restart facesense-api
```

## Documentation

- Auto-generated: http://localhost:8000/docs (Swagger)
- ReDoc: http://localhost:8000/redoc

## Notes

- Models are CPU-only (no GPU on VPS)
- One image per request (no batching)
- Timeout: 30 seconds max
- Max image: 10 MB
- Expected latency: 300-800ms cloud mode

